letter (September / October / November): Wheelchair Basketball Open Gym, ages 8+, Wednesdays 5:30 – 8:15pm and Select Saturdays 1:00 – 5:00pm, FREE (code 136166), volunteer-led by JT (Roll to Success) at Park de la Cruz Gymnasium. Remaining sibling sport cards stay on this parent — do not split a second TRS row: Archery Select Thursdays 11:00am – 1:00pm, Sept. Dynamic Inclusive Dance is dance — keep under this parent, not a new sports parent. Harvest Ball Saturday, November 7, 2026 is dinner/dancing — not a sports parent. S4EA co-sponsored Fall cards stay on Sports for Exceptional Athletes, not a second TRS sports parent. Distinct from already-listed San Diego Wolf Pack Wheelchair Basketball. Distinct from San Diego Silverbacks. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name).', NULL, 0, NULL);
