ng Opening Day March 21 / Closing May 16 is past — keep under this parent, do not split a second spring row. Game Schedule page still reprints Fall Ball 2025 field locations (Folsom National Sheldon Park, 362 Natoma Station Drive, Folsom, CA 95630; Maidu Regional Park, 1550 Maidu Drive, Roseville, CA 95661; Deputy Jeff Mitchell Field, 860 Redwood Lane, El Dorado Hills CA 95762) — leftover 2025 card, quoted; not treated as the 2026 play street. A printed Fall 2026 play street is not on the Registration page opened (More details to follow). Distinct from Miracle League of Stanislaus County. Distinct from City of Roseville Adaptive Youth Flag Football League. Do not invent a statewide California Challenger parent. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name).', NULL, 0, NULL);
