0Z', '2026-09-01T02:36:11.959Z', '2026-09-04T06:00:57.988Z', '[description] Office hours Mon/Wed/Fri, 9 a.m. - 1 p.m.; Closed Tuesday/Thursday, Saturday/Sunday are office hours, not play. $50.00. Leftover rec banner Fall 2026 JUSA Recreational Registration - WAITLIST ONLY is rec, not this TOPSoccer card. Chrome Copyright © 2026 Junior United Soccer Association. Distinct from already-piled Orange Junior Soccer Club TOPSoccer (city of Orange). Distinct from La Mirada Soccer Association TOPSoccer. Do not invent a statewide California TOPSoccer parent. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name). [cost_note] Leftover rec banner Fall 2026 JUSA Recreational Registration - WAITLIST ONLY is rec, not this TOPSoccer fee. [ages] A printed numeric floor is not on the Fall 2026 registration page opened.', NULL, 0, NULL);
