ot this TOPS card — do not write those rec fields as the TOPS play street. Leftover Lil Kickers desk lilkickers@atascaderosoccer.org is rec, not this TOPS card. Leftover rec u6-u19 - $180 is rec, not this TOPS fee. Leftover Early Bird Discount - $20 per player (Deadline 5/18/2026) is past. Leftover $3 processing fee Sports Connect (non-refundable). Cal South District 7 lists CC Dynasty Futbol Club; official CCDFC homepage reprints the City of Atascadero / Atascadero Youth Soccer Program partnership and checks payable to CCDFC — do not add a second CCDFC parent. Leftover CCDFC mail PO Box 90, Atascadero, California 93423 / info@ccdynastyfc.com stays quoted, not a second parent. A printed AYS / TOPS desk phone is not on the official Fall 2026 pages opened — phone left blank. Distinct from already-piled JUSA TOPSoccer. Distinct from Orange Junior Soccer Club TOPSoccer. Distinct from La Mirada Soccer Association TOPSoccer. Do not invent a statewide California TOPSoccer parent. Do not invent a second CC Dynasty FC parent. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name). [cost_note] Leftover Early Bird Discount - $20 per player (Deadline 5/18/2026) is past. Leftover $3 processing fee Sports Connect (non-refundable). Leftover rec u6-u19 - $180 is rec, not this TOPS fee.', NULL, 0, NULL);
