n this parent: RAD Pickleball ages 10+, Saturdays 10:00am-11:00am at Wackman Park, 5851 Laguna Quail Drive, Elk Grove, CA 95758 (Tennis Court 1 & 2), 9/12, 9/26, 10/10, 10/24, $11. RAD Fitness Club / Yoga / Zumba / Fall Dances / Fun Friday / cooking / kids builders / performing arts / parent group / RAD Swim stay on this parent, HOLD as sports parents — not a second RAD row. Distinct from Elk Grove Soccer TOPSoccer. Do not invent Adaptive Sports California.', NULL, 0, NULL);
