02Z', '[description] August 2026 Newsletter reprints remaining Fall practices (bowling / flag football / floor hockey / volleyball starting September; tentatively scheduled) — stay on this parent. Halloween SPORTS Camp Oct 23–25, 2026 at Camp Marston, 4761 Pine Hills Rd, Julian 92036 stays on this parent (Julian is San Diego County, not a second city parent). Sep 26 Pancake Breakfast and Oct 10 Oktoberfest are fundraisers / social — stay on this parent, not new sports parents. City of San Diego TRS co-sponsor cards stay on this parent, not a second TRS sports parent. One club row; do not smash into Special Olympics California or City of San Diego TRS. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name).', NULL, 0, NULL);
