and a printed Mahany / Placer Valley / Maidu street number are not on the Adaptive / Sports Field Rentals pages opened. Remaining sibling sport cards stay on this parent: Sports Hangouts basketball Oct 20 (ages 6-17) / Oct 6 (18+) at Mahany Fitness Center 6-7pm; kickball Sept 27 (6-17) / Oct 11 (18+) at Maidu Covered Soccer Arena 3-4pm; soccer Nov 15 (6-17) / Nov 8 (18+) at Maidu Covered Soccer Arena 3-4pm; $15 resident / $20 non-resident. Sensory Fall Festival Oct 14, Floating Pumpkin Patch Oct 18, and Halloween socials are crafts / socials — HOLD as sports parents. Distinct from District 54 Challenger Little League. Do not invent Adaptive Sports California.', NULL, 0, NULL);
