orbes Way, Suite 200, Long Beach, CA 90810 is SoCal chrome — not this child''s city. Leftover Kern development 661.383.2905 / tcobb@sosc.org. Distinct from AYSO Region 73 EPIC. Do not add a second SOCA / SOSC / Kern parent. Do not smash SONC into SOSC. Do not smash Special Olympics California into a Fresno-only parent. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name).', NULL, 0, NULL);
