 (past) — not invented as the Fall 2026 play address. Distinct from District 54 Challenger Little League. Distinct from Miracle League of San Francisco Peninsula. Distinct from Miracle League of San Diego. Do not invent a statewide California Miracle League parent. Not Adaptive Sports California (invented name).', NULL, 0, NULL);
